      "88b8e6aaa49d": "Current hashes match. Accepted October 11 repair is reviewer-reported; receipt retains shared semantic-gate alias failure. Notes report 41 tests, 300 lessons/1200 query rotations, not a newly executed four-query production check. Current API grid_h/grid_w<=8 cannot supply 20-side outputs; this is a scope limit, not poor labels.",
